ids, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle ran 48% of normal in July to August and 42% in August to September. Both grids had their driest year in 1963, with grid 24198 at 70% and grid 24498 at 69%. On grid 24498 the preliminary August to September 2026 estimate sits at 185.8.</p>"}
